---
// Setup in one command, with the console replay site.mjs plays once it
// scrolls into view.
---

<section class="deploy-band" id="deploy" aria-labelledby="deploy-title">
  <div class="wrap deploy">
    <div class="deploy-copy">
      <h2 id="deploy-title">Set it up with one command</h2>
      <p>
        The command signs you in to Cloudflare, lists the domains in your
        account and deploys the whole workspace there.
      </p>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          Run <code>bun create @open-workspace</code> and sign in to Cloudflare.
        </li>
        <li>
          Pick your account, your mail domains and an AI provider. It deploys
          the workspace.
        </li>
        <li>Open the app, create your admin account and invite your team.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="more">
        <a href="/docs/deploy">Read the setup guide</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="term" aria-labelledby="term-cap">
      <div class="term-bar">
        <span class="term-title">~/projects</span>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="copy copy-quiet"
          data-copy-text="bun create @open-workspace"
        >
          Copy command
        </button>
      </div>
      <pre
        class="term-body"
        tabindex="0"
      ><code is:raw><span class="ln ln-cmd" style="--i:0"><span class="dim">$</span> bun create @open-workspace</span><span class="ln" style="--i:1"><span class="g">┌</span>  <b>OpenWorkspace</b></span><span class="ln" style="--i:2"><span class="ok">◇</span>  Project name  <span class="ans">acme-workspace</span></span><span class="ln" style="--i:3"><span class="ok">◆</span>  Signed in to Cloudflare</span><span class="ln" style="--i:4"><span class="ok">◇</span>  Account  <span class="ans">Acme</span></span><span class="ln" style="--i:5"><span class="ok">◇</span>  Mail domains  <span class="ans">acme.com</span></span><span class="ln" style="--i:6"><span class="ok">◇</span>  Hostname  <span class="ans">mail.acme.com</span></span><span class="ln" style="--i:7"><span class="ok">◇</span>  AI  <span class="ans">Cloudflare AI Gateway</span></span><span class="ln" style="--i:8"><span class="ok">◇</span>  Deploying with Alchemy <span class="dim">…</span></span><span class="ln" style="--i:9"><span class="ok">◆</span>  Deployed to Acme</span><span class="ln" style="--i:10"><span class="g">└</span>  Open https://mail.acme.com and create the first administrator.<span class="caret" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></code></pre>
      <figcaption id="term-cap" class="visually-hidden">
        The setup command’s session, with example answers for acme.com.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
